# UI Link Consistency — ERP_RMI_SOFULL

## Prinsip

**Saat perubahan UI (label, link, struktur, rename modul), WAJIB sesuaikan semua referensi di seluruh frontend.**

## Area Frontend yang Harus Dicek

| Area | Lokasi | Contoh |
|------|--------|--------|
| **Topbar actions** | `rmi_header(..., ['actions' => [...]])` di tiap halaman | RFQ, PO, Import Control Tower |
| **Sidebar** | `_shared/rmi_layout.php` — `$u[...]` + nav-link | PQP (Dashboard), RFQ, PO, AP, Forwarding |
| **Content cards** | Body halaman (dashboard, index) | Cards di PQP Dashboard |
| **Breadcrumb** | `rmi_header(..., ['breadcrumbs' => [...]])` | PQP → Dashboard |
| **Back links** | Tombol "← Kembali" di halaman detail | ← PQP Dashboard, ← RFQ |
| **Master Data** | `master/master_data.php` — mod_card() | Card PQP Dashboard |
| **Cross-module links** | Halaman modul lain yang link ke modul ini | wqs_pr.php → PQP Dashboard |

## Checklist Saat Ubah UI

- [ ] **Topbar actions** — Hapus/tambah/ubah di `rmi_header()` halaman terkait
- [ ] **Sidebar** — Cek `rmi_layout.php`: `$u` array + nav-link data-roles
- [ ] **Content** — Cards, tombol, link di body halaman
- [ ] **Breadcrumb** — Label & URL di `rmi_header()`
- [ ] **Back links** — Tombol kembali di halaman child (view, edit, dll.)
- [ ] **master_data.php** — mod_card jika modul punya entry di Master Data Center
- [ ] **Cross-reference** — Grep modul/label lama di seluruh codebase

## Contoh: Rename "Purchases Dashboard" → "PQP Dashboard"

File yang perlu diupdate:
- `purchases/purchases_dashboard.php` — rmi_header title, breadcrumb
- `purchases/purchases_import_control_tower.php` — back link
- `stock/wqs_pr.php` — button label
- `master/master_data.php` — mod_card title
- `_shared/rmi_layout.php` — sidebar nav-link label

## Grep untuk Cek

```bash
grep -r "Purchases Dashboard" --include="*.php" .
grep -r "purchases_dashboard" --include="*.php" .
```
